{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23548","headline":"登阊门闲望 · 白居易","name":"登阊门闲望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阊门四望郁苍苍，始觉州雄土俗强。\n十万夫家供课税，五千子弟守封疆。\n阖闾城碧铺秋草，乌鹊桥红带夕阳。\n处处楼前飘管吹，家家门外泊舟航。\n云埋虎寺山藏色，月耀娃宫水放光。\n曾赏钱唐嫌茂苑，今来未敢苦夸张。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}